MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Ism_m01_01: I'll bring all I have to bear.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Kai0_m01_01: It's a test of strength. I'm all in.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Kai1_m01_01: I'll use everything I've learned.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Dit_m01_01: I thrum... Let it begin!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Seo_m01_01: This reminds me of the sparring of my youth.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Led_m01_01: A chance to experiment with new moves.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Bel_m01_01: I'm always glad for a challenge.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Tal_m01_01: Well don't you look strong.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Orh_m01_01: We'll learn so much from this!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Anh_m01_01: I can win if I remember the fundamentals.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Tia0_m01_01: What a perfect opportunity to learn.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Tia1_m01_01: I'll put my studies to work.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Pet0_m01_01: Go easy on me...please.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Pet1_m01_01: I'll get stronger. I'm going all out.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Hur_m01_01: No wasted opportunities. I'll hit you with all I've got!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Max_m01_01: I'll use this as a chance to learn.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Jes_m01_01: The stronger they are...the more fun it is\nbeatin' 'em!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Gol_m01_01: Psh, I'll be fine! You should see what I do to pillars.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Gat_m01_01: One must endure suffering to achieve growth.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Dan_m01_01: It calls to mind champion Breza's training on\nMount Orgus...
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Fab_m01_01: You may prove to be taxing.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Esm_m01_01: Bet you're tough to handle—like a storm at sea!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Mic_m01_01: Let's spar, and spar again!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Urs_m01_01: I'll have to be careful here.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Sim_m01_01: Looks like you're gonna make me get serious.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Lou_m01_01: I'll learn all I can and be better for it!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Fia_m01_01: I'm not sure training with me will be worth\nyour time...
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Die_m01_01: You're going to be trouble. But I'll steal your\nbest moves if I can.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Lor0_m01_01: Ha! Don't get cocky or else you're gonna be in a\nworld of hurt!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Lor1_m01_01: I'll show you how much I've grown!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Set_m01_01: You seem well-practiced. Then I'll hold\nnothing back.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Nin_m01_01: Back to basics. Survive or die.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Bon_m01_01: I see this as a prime opportunity to learn.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Tob_m01_01: Baw haw haw! I bet you'll give me a real fight!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Lil_m01_01: I'll be keeping an eye on your technique.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Lys_m01_01: A well fought match is a valuable experience.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Buc_m01_01: I don't doubt your skills. Will you duel?
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Sci_m01_01: It's just like the drills I did when I was younger.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Moo0_m01_01: Whew, you're tough...but I'm gonna win!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Moo1_m01_01: Sorry, but you won't beat me.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Oly_m01_01: Only through rigorous training may we attain\ngreatness!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Naz_m01_01: Hahahaha! Now here's a real opponent.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Sar_m01_01: All my skill will be tested here.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Dai_m01_01: Oooh. I'm gonna give this one all I got!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Hal_m01_01: Eep! Please go easy on me.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Guj_m01_01: Pretty good, are you? No match for me, though.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Yan_m01_01: I would have you join me in my training!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Iio_m01_01: A perfect opponent to hone my skills with.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Pep_m01_01: A strong opponent? Tremendous!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Noc_m01_01: Now this looks like a challenge. Nice!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Sop_m01_01: Well, I'll try my best!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Cat_m01_01: A strong opponent. Thrilling!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Ned_m01_01: Your technique... I'd like to study it.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Zac_m01_01: Hey, go easy on me, huh?
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Maj_m01_01: Nobody's stronger than me!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Ven_m01_01: Ha. I'll make light work of this fool.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Ini_m01_01: A strong opponent... Glad to have this chance.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Jas_m01_01: Better opponent, bigger challenge!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Ale_m01_01: I'll give it my all!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Cle_m01_01: 
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Mys_m01_01: 
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Nat_m01_01: A skilled opponent. Very good.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Hri_m01_01: I won't let my guard down. Prepare yourself.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Tro_m01_01: I need to remember to take you seriously.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Cen_m01_01: I desire a test of my mettle. Care for a bout?
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Asw_m01_01: I will test the skills I have honed.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Kou_m01_01: I suspect you're a deceptively tough foe.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Nuz_m01_01: You're a formidable opponent, I see.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Kir_m01_01: Kiroc the Rukh ain't afraid!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Ism_m02_01: I should approach this with care.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Kai0_m02_01: This'll be a good refresher.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Kai1_m02_01: This'll be a fun fight.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Dit_m02_01: Bare your fangs to me!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Seo_m02_01: This will be a fruitful training session.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Led_m02_01: Training or not—don't let your guard down.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Bel_m02_01: Training is key to victory.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Tal_m02_01: Time is coin, friend. Let's make sure this was worth it.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Orh_m02_01: Please, don't hold back.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Anh_m02_01: Regular training is the key to improvement.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Tia0_m02_01: I'll demonstrate everything I've learned.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Tia1_m02_01: Let's bring all our skills to this fight.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Pet0_m02_01: *gulp* I-I'll do my best.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Pet1_m02_01: I'll focus on all my training.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Hur_m02_01: This will be a good chance to test myself.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Max_m02_01: Gotta improve as a knight!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Jes_m02_01: Hahaha! A nice little toy.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Gol_m02_01: No do-overs, got it?
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Gat_m02_01: We must all better ourselves.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Dan_m02_01: To stay sharp, one must hone one's skills!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Fab_m02_01: Well, it won't be a total waste of time.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Esm_m02_01: Strength is more than raw power!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Mic_m02_01: I need to train. I need to get better!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Urs_m02_01: This should be a good opportunity to improve.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Sim_m02_01: In battle, it's your training that keeps you alive.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Lou_m02_01: I'll train hard to keep the team safe!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Fia_m02_01: I won't hold back, so neither should you.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Die_m02_01: There's no need to hold back. I know I won't.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Lor0_m02_01: Here's what I got when I give it my all!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Lor1_m02_01: Alright! Bring it on!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Set_m02_01: Let's make this a worthwhile exercise.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Nin_m02_01: We're evenly matched. Expect my very best.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Bon_m02_01: I believe we could learn much from each other.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Tob_m02_01: Oh, this little training bout is gonna be fun!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Lil_m02_01: You should be able to take what I dish out, right?
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Lys_m02_01: Through battle, I refine myself into greatness.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Buc_m02_01: A worthy opponent.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Sci_m02_01: Like a zephyr, I'll knock you off your feet!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Moo0_m02_01: Let's both learn from each other!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Moo1_m02_01: You'd better give it all you got. I sure will.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Oly_m02_01: Never lazy, always striving!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Naz_m02_01: Alright, the gloves are off!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Sar_m02_01: Let's both try our best, hm?
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Dai_m02_01: Time to find out which of us is stronger!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Hal_m02_01: I'll show you I'm no pushover!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Guj_m02_01: Let's go—move for move!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Yan_m02_01: You need not hold back. Come!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Iio_m02_01: No need to hesitate.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Pep_m02_01: A true test of skills! Hold nothing back!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Noc_m02_01: This should be fun, right?
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Sop_m02_01: A little fighting makes us stronger? OK!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Cat_m02_01: I'll show you the full extent of my skills!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Ned_m02_01: You're a good match for me. I wish you luck.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Zac_m02_01: Hey, now don't get carried away here...
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Maj_m02_01: Nothin' personal here...
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Ven_m02_01: I know what you're thinking. It's an honor to\ntrain with me!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Ini_m02_01: This will be good practice, I'm certain.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Jas_m02_01: Now this'll be good.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Ale_m02_01: Give it your best effort and I will too.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Cle_m02_01: 
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Mys_m02_01: 
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Nat_m02_01: Don't hesitate—I won't.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Hri_m02_01: Now this looks like it'll be fun.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Tro_m02_01: Let's see how skilled you really are.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Cen_m02_01: Let's ensure this makes both of us better.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Asw_m02_01: Training or no, I will apply my best efforts.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Kou_m02_01: We can both learn from this battle.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Nuz_m02_01: There is no learning the Har Hali way without pain.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Kir_m02_01: It's just for laughs, right? Then let's get to it.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Ism_m03_01: I look forward to our match.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Kai0_m03_01: Let's go.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Kai1_m03_01: Don't expect any weakness from me.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Dit_m03_01: Do you seek death?
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Seo_m03_01: A queen leads by example. So watch closely.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Led_m03_01: Any injuries you get, don't blame me.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Bel_m03_01: Just training—it's fine if we get a little rough.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Tal_m03_01: If you get hurt, send the medical bill to Vandahl \nTrading.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Orh_m03_01: I'll be very careful. I don't want to hurt you.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Anh_m03_01: Remember to roll with the punches.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Tia0_m03_01: I accept the challenge.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Tia1_m03_01: Sure, I'll fight.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Pet0_m03_01: I-I'll try not to hurt you.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Pet1_m03_01: You're on.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Hur_m03_01: I'll make sure I'm ready for whatever you've got.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Max_m03_01: All to achieve peace.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Jes_m03_01: Heh heh HEH. Ready to play?
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Gol_m03_01: Gimme what you got!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Gat_m03_01: I intend for this to be civil.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Dan_m03_01: Maybe I'll get some material...
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Fab_m03_01: This is likely a waste of my time.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Esm_m03_01: I'm not holding back—I warn you!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Mic_m03_01: I can take it—don't hold back!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Urs_m03_01: Seems you still need a lesson in the basics.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Sim_m03_01: You must be the warm-up.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Lou_m03_01: Thanks to my father's training, I know just how to\nlight a fire under you!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Fia_m03_01: Umm... I'll try not to hurt you too bad, OK?
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Die_m03_01: I'll try to go easy on you. Let's start.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Lor0_m03_01: Hey, if you get hurt, it's not my fault!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Lor1_m03_01: Come at me strong—or you're gonna get hurt.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Set_m03_01: Come now, whenever you're ready. Let the\nlesson begin.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Nin_m03_01: I'll train you. I'll be glad to.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Bon_m03_01: Even a master can learn through teaching.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Tob_m03_01: I'm an old hand at training green recruits.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Lil_m03_01: Don't come whining to me if you get hurt.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Lys_m03_01: Perhaps I needn't quite go all out.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Buc_m03_01: I'm ready. Be mindful to lean away from my attacks.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Sci_m03_01: You think you can catch the wind?
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Moo0_m03_01: Come on! Like you mean it!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Moo1_m03_01: You want a challenge, I'll give you one!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Oly_m03_01: I pray you don't end up too badly hurt...
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Naz_m03_01: If you get hurt, don't say I didn't warn you.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Sar_m03_01: Don't worry about a few bruises. I can heal you.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Dai_m03_01: Relax. I ain't gonna give you the full Dadao.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Hal_m03_01: We can start whenever you're ready.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Guj_m03_01: Do your worst. I'm the "Unkillable Guzran"!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Yan_m03_01: I shall be your opponent!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Iio_m03_01: Show me what you're made of.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Pep_m03_01: What bravery and spirit!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Noc_m03_01: If I hurt you, no complaints, OK?
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Sop_m03_01: Alright! Give it your all!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Cat_m03_01: Make it known—you trained with me!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Ned_m03_01: I'll show you the ropes.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Zac_m03_01: Sooo, a shakedown, huh?
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Maj_m03_01: Fine, I'll show you a thing or two.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Ven_m03_01: I, teach you? Today is your lucky day.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Ini_m03_01: I'll try not to hit my hardest...
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Jas_m03_01: I won't go easy on you!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Ale_m03_01: You asked, so I'll oblige!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Cle_m03_01: 
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Mys_m03_01: 
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Nat_m03_01: Trying to learn from me, are you?
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Hri_m03_01: Well! I'll show you what battle really is.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Tro_m03_01: Don't be shy. Show me what you've got.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Cen_m03_01: Come. Learn how to fight a seasoned warrior.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Asw_m03_01: I have no intention of hurting you.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Kou_m03_01: You came to fight. So let's fight.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Nuz_m03_01: Be warned. I'm not used to holding back.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Kir_m03_01: Small fry? Almost ain't worth the trouble...
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Anh_Sar_m01_01: You'll tell me if you get hurt while training, right?\nI don't want you fighting through the pain.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Anh_Sar_m01_02: I would expect the same from you, as someone I am\nsworn to protect.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Anh_Naz_m01_01: Here we go, Anatolia. You better not go easy on me!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Anh_Naz_m01_02: Never, Nezha. Even practice combat must be\napproached seriously.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Urs_Sim_m01_01: If you hold back your best, Simon, you may come\nto regret it.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Urs_Sim_m01_02: Half-effort in front of the manager? Wouldn't dream\nof it!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Hur_Gol_m01_01: Bwahaha! So it's you and me, hon! This'll be a good\nmatch, I bet.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Hur_Gol_m01_02: Aw, that's nice, coming from the Butcher. Let's go.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Hur_Cen_m01_01: I protect those I hold dear as well as myself. And I\nwill not relent.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Hur_Cen_m01_02: What else is new? Uh, I mean, I'll do my best!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Esm_Kir_m01_01: Boo! I'm a ghost! Not really, but maybe I can help\nyou get over your fear!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Esm_Kir_m01_02: What?! Forget it! You as a ghost would\nmake me drop dead!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Esm_Lys_m01_01: Ooh, that smug face! I'm going to make you cry!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Esm_Lys_m01_02: The only crying you'll hear is my battle cry!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Orh_Bon_m01_01: I think it's most polite in these circumstances to use\none's full strength.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Orh_Bon_m01_02: How considerate. Then I will come at you with\nmy very best too.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Kai0_Esm_m01_01: Thanks for doing this with me, Esmeralda. I've got\na bunch of fighting techniques I wanna try out.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Kai0_Esm_m01_02: Right, Cai, let's do this! I won't hold back for\na second!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Kai0_Tia0_m01_01: Look out, Cai. You're about to see how much\nstronger I've gotten.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Kai0_Tia0_m01_02: I hope so, but don't think you're leaving me behind.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Kai0_Nin_m01_01: I have to get serious against a fighter like you, Ninae.\nTime to show you the skills Pop taught me.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Kai0_Nin_m01_02: Trained by Windstorm himself... Then you can\nexpect my full force.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Jes_Noc_m01_01: Heh heh HEH! Ready to get diced up? Hope you\nscream nice and loud for me...
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Jes_Noc_m01_02: Save the chatter till we're done. And stop delaying.\nI'll begin!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Sci_Moo1_m01_01: Ah, delicate one sprouted from the battlefield's\nsoils. Would you grant the wind a dance?
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Sci_Moo1_m01_02: Let's focus on the bout, OK? Can't believe you can\nact so flirty without letting your guard down...
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Seo_Tia1_m01_01: This may be a training session, but I still plan to fight\nyou using all the tricks I know.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Seo_Tia1_m01_02: Heh. I applaud your dedication. Let us see\nthese tricks you speak of!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Seo_Tob_m01_01: As you well know, I prefer an intense battle. It is my\nfavored way of relieving stress.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Seo_Tob_m01_02: Baw haw haw! I remember when you were\nknee-high, boss. Look at you now!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Seo_Bon_m01_01: This duel puts me in mind of Your Majesty's\nchildhood.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Seo_Bon_m01_02: You look the same to me now as then. I hope you\nwill remain steadfast and loyal as ever.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Set_Dai_m01_01: Come, Dadao. We have a great opportunity here.\nShow me what you can do.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Set_Dai_m01_02: I dunno what you're expecting, but I'll give it a shot.\nJust remember, you asked for this!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Tal_Mic_m01_01: The "Mikaela Redblade." Hope you're as fun as\nI imagined.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Tal_Mic_m01_02: Of course! More fun than you can handle!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Tal_Lou_m01_01: You won't catch me holding back, so you better give\nit your all too, Talimun!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Tal_Lou_m01_02: Sure, sure, but watch the face, will you? We've still\ngot work to do, you know.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Tia0_Ven_m01_01: You! Dream-crusher! Kids these days, never\ngiving elders their due...
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Tia0_Ven_m01_02: Can we do the lectures later? It's training time.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Dit_Fab_m01_01: Your power interests me. Lay it bare!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Dit_Fab_m01_02: I do not know if you will be satisfied, but to be so\ndesired is no bad thing.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Dit_Mic_m01_01: Don't forget, we're just training. I do not need you\nto kill me.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Dit_Mic_m01_02: Hm? So you say. But I may take your head.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Die_Nin_m01_01: A chance to test our skills on each other?\nI have no problem with this at all.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Die_Nin_m01_02: The spirits are astir... You must mean to truly\nattack me, Diego.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Tob_Lil_m01_01: The Lionheart of Saramis, stooping to train one of\nthe grunts? How generous of you.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Tob_Lil_m01_02: Aww, shucks! You don't gotta make a big deal\nout of it.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Naz_Dai_m01_01: Dadao! Today's the day we settle which one of us\nis stronger.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Naz_Dai_m01_02: You're on! It's about time I shut you up on the\nsubject for good.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Nat_Iio_m01_01: Facing you here takes me back to when we used to\nspar. Let us train like we did in Arago!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Nat_Iio_m01_02: I see that same idealism burning in your eyes.\nAlright, then. Show me how far you've come!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Buc_Sci_m01_01: So! House Cohendia's infamous Demon Bear.\nPlease, don't make this too easy for me.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Buc_Sci_m01_02: Bold words, Silver Hail. Let's see if your skills live up\nto your bluster.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Pet0_Sop_m01_01: After this, Petey, let's grab some food. I'm always\nhungry after training.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Pet0_Sop_m01_02: Yes! I couldn't agree more. I'm planning on working\nup an appetite.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Pet1_Nin_m01_01: You don't let down your guard, do you, Ninae?\nI'll have to approach this carefully.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Pet1_Nin_m01_02: You seem to have grown in skill, Peter. Now,\nyou will see what I can do.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Fab_Mys_m01_01: I am relieved to have you here. No other shares\nmy perspective—or my skill.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Fab_Mys_m01_02: Nice words, and I'll take the compliment. But just\nremember, I'm no tool to be used and discarded.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Fia_Lys_m01_01: Let me know if I do anything to injure you. I'll see to\nit you get medical treatment at once.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Fia_Lys_m01_02: Th-thank you. Then allow me to return the favor.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Bel_Hri_m01_01: I'm humbled to be facing off against the White-\nManed Demon of the Arena. Try to be merciful.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Bel_Hri_m01_02: Heh. Please. It'll take all I have to stop the Pantere\nfrom trouncing me.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Bel_Naz_m01_01: Promise me you'll go all out. Otherwise I'll never get\nany better.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Bel_Naz_m01_02: Of course—and likewise. Fight like you mean to take\nme down.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Bon_Lil_m01_01: Hey, when I beat you, do I get a bonus?
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Bon_Lil_m01_02: Well now! Aren't we confident? Let us spar first,\nand then we shall see.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Mic_Guj_m01_01: My stories of bravery need more punch! Let's write a\nnew one, here and now, in our blood!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Mic_Guj_m01_02: It's nice you like me so much, but I don't need to star\nin one of your drunken tales!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Mic_Sim_m01_01: You wanted your chance to turn the tables on me?\nWell, here it is!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Mic_Sim_m01_02: If I hold back, I know I'll never hear the end of it.\nAlright, gimme your best shot!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Moo0_Oly_m01_01: Here I go, Olympia! Gonna show you what I'm\nmade of!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Moo0_Oly_m01_02: By all means. Stand proud before the Blue Rose\nof Caelus!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Lil_Ned_m01_01: It's good to see a familiar face in here. I know I can\ngo full force against you!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Lil_Ned_m01_02: You've got guts, Lilian. I'll steel myself too.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Led_Sci_m01_01: A beautiful rose, beloved by Kalla herself. I hesitate\nto fight, lest I hurt you...
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Led_Sci_m01_02: Try it. You'll find this rose's thorns are sharp.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Led_Die_m01_01: I'm glad we have this chance to train. I want to see\nyour moves up close.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Led_Die_m01_02: I'll be learning your techniques too. So, how\nabout we get to studying each other?
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Ism_m04_01: With this power, I will be a light for the world.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Kai0_m04_01: I'll do my best, just like that.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Kai1_m04_01: I can feel my training paying off.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Dit_m04_01: And yet I climb.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Seo_m04_01: I have higher pinnacles to reach.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Led_m04_01: One step closer to my true goal.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Bel_m04_01: Very good. But I still have a ways to go.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Tal_m04_01: Well, look at that. I'm getting stronger!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Orh_m04_01: I'll protect everyone even better now.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Anh_m04_01: I hope to mentor others as I was once taught.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Tia0_m04_01: I'm dedicated to getting better and better.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Tia1_m04_01: Continual rapid improvement, that's my motto.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Pet0_m04_01: Alright, if I can just keep this up...
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Pet1_m04_01: I'll keep improving my skills.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Hur_m04_01: I feel like I've gotten even stronger.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Max_m04_01: Yes, I'm better than ever!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Jes_m04_01: Hyahahaha! The staaar of the show!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Gol_m04_01: I could smash a crater in the ground!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Gat_m04_01: More polished than before.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Dan_m04_01: It appears my research paid off!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Fab_m04_01: I have gained some puissance.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Esm_m04_01: I hooked myself a big'un!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Mic_m04_01: Ah, yes. If I train this hard, I'll be fine, come\nwhat may.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Urs_m04_01: I've excelled. Right on track.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Sim_m04_01: I can feel my skills getting sharper.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Lou_m04_01: I'm strong enough for whatever comes next!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Fia_m04_01: With this power, I should be even more useful.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Die_m04_01: You can count on me for protection—against any\nand all threats.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Lor0_m04_01: I'm going to get tough enough to survive no\nmatter where I go!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Lor1_m04_01: I managed that pretty good, I think!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Set_m04_01: The natural result of never giving up.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Nin_m04_01: I have grown in ability. I can feel that, truly.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Bon_m04_01: Haha! Still I find new limits to surpass.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Tob_m04_01: I just keep gettin' stronger!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Lil_m04_01: I wouldn't say this is my peak just yet.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Lys_m04_01: Ah! I have once again surpassed myself.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Buc_m04_01: It seems I really am in my prime.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Sci_m04_01: I possess the power of a tempest!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Moo0_m04_01: Gotta keep growing just like that!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Moo1_m04_01: All I can do is to keep improving.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Oly_m04_01: This flower grows, and grows, and grows!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Naz_m04_01: I won't rest until I'm stronger than anyone!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Sar_m04_01: There's still more I can do as a protector.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Dai_m04_01: How about that?! There's no stopping me!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Hal_m04_01: Hey, I think I'm getting better at this!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Guj_m04_01: Ha. Still, a pale imitation of battle glory.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Yan_m04_01: I have grasped something.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Iio_m04_01: One step closer to the knightly ideal.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Pep_m04_01: Our heart brims with this success!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Noc_m04_01: I'm more than strong enough.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Sop_m04_01: Got a whole lot better!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Cat_m04_01: I expect the best of myself—for my future lord.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Ned_m04_01: I made the most of my training.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Zac_m04_01: You see that? No one here can match me.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Maj_m04_01: I'm in a whole 'nother league!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Ven_m04_01: Dignified, determined, and destined!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Ini_m04_01: I've gotten stronger. Yes, I can feel it.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Jas_m04_01: I think I learned something!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Ale_m04_01: I've trained hard, and it's paid off.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Cle_m04_01: 
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Mys_m04_01: 
