MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Lou_m05_01: From here, I'll get even stronger!
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Fia_m05_01: I think I've grown a little stronger.
MID_SV_ArenaTrain_Die_m05_01: I've got to get stronger than this.
